'' RUN: optional-caller-line under -exx. The raise clears the function name -exx records on
'' Value( )'s entry, so the abort reads 'of <caller>.tiko(), ...' and not '::VALUE()' -- the
'' callee's name beside the caller's file.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -exx -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/optional-caller-line.tiko -o tests/codegen/optcallerlinex.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/optcallerlinex.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: caught 1 7
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: caught 1 18
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: Aborting due to runtime error 1 (illegal function call) at line 32 of
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: optional-caller-line.tiko(), Value( ) of an empty Optional
